## Agustín Rojas — Actuarial Consulting & Quantitative Analytics

**Greetings!** I'm Agustín Rojas, an advanced Actuarial Science student based in [Buenos Aires](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buenos_Aires). My work focuses on bridging the gap between mathematical rigor, risk management, and scalable data architecture.

### Expertise & Value Proposition

I specialize in designing end-to-end quantitative and data-driven solutions:
* **Actuarial Modeling & Pricing:** Valuation of contingent contracts, loss reserving, and rate-making using sound statistical methods.
* **Financial Risk Strategy:** Solvency assessment, capital loss mitigation, and dynamic scenario forecasting.
* **Data Architecture & Automation:** Engineering automated data pipelines (ETL) across relational databases and migrating manual workflows into robust, auditable systems.
* **Business Intelligence:** Developing interactive executive dashboards for real-time tracking of core business indicators.

### Problem-Solving & Strategic Impact

I approach every challenge with analytical rigor and an engineering mindset. My goal is to reduce operational uncertainty and turn complex data into clear, scalable, and business-driven strategies.

### Continuous Growth & Global Perspective

The dynamic landscape of data and quantitative finance inspires me to continually adopt international market practices in insurance and reinsurance, tailoring them to regional needs through reproducible and ethical methodologies.

### Let's Connect

Whether you are looking to optimize pricing models, automate data pipelines, or develop custom analytical dashboards, I'd be glad to collaborate.

_Let's build something impactful together!_

